だと思う《that ...》 / 申し上げにくいのですが...《to say that ...》/ ...を恐れている《of ...》 / ...の安否を心配する《for ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5af385141e4ab389a4e1","expressionId":"x_7437b1f4744ebacaf125","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》 〈事〉に先だって, ...の前に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_538f9cc0c05c2a3ef4e9","expressionId":"x_cdd3dbac09b7816ee143","language":"ja","text":"見地,観点([[viewpoint]]) / 考え方,態度","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_1bc663bd264a397067e6","expressionId":"x_0bc636052561ebc523ae","language":"ja","text":"...という理由で《that ...》 /  ...という理由で, ...を根拠として《of ...》/ ...の敷地に《of ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_d1b255ebf4ef023fffe5","expressionId":"x_0d2216989b3ed911b821","language":"ja","text":"（事が）起こる, 発生する /（行事などが）行われる, 開催される","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c5cea15e2223492179cb","expressionId":"x_f6595ed4e298322c81a5","language":"ja","text":"（まるで）...であるかのように","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_07f284b684eaea94145e","expressionId":"x_55892a8dcb2c4b181bdc","language":"ja","text":"...に反して","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_47bbea859f2ba1270f48","expressionId":"x_5818cdf030caa84009e1","language":"ja","text":"...しない. ...しそこなう, ...できない《~ do》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_fec9659392d5aab81eea","expressionId":"x_12b518c9c74b1d9f1c35","language":"ja","text":"まるで...であるかのように, まるで...するかのように","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_d20d66bd465e6a33b8ea","expressionId":"x_a324d4e0cb6d7505777d","language":"ja","text":"...のほかは全員, ...のほかは全部 / ほとんど, おおむね / ...も同然で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ed1e0a3828d79e0f9e01","expressionId":"x_1514251104d98c9c5d69","language":"ja","text":"《願望・後悔》...であればなあ, ...でありさえすればなあ / 【名】あのときああしておけばという後悔の念","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b20fee82d4ff81236397","expressionId":"x_9aec52c93318e739f8b8","language":"ja","text":"ある程度","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e3542ed0f132cc142955","expressionId":"x_9cd3edbd137633569eb2","language":"ja","text":"《通例否定文･疑問文で》長い間","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_d518cd40a561b435032a","expressionId":"x_fe11b43214f142122013","language":"ja","text":"路上で, 道路に出て / 旅行中で, 出張中で, 巡業中で / （車が）走行可能な, 走れる / 《