4bb567","language":"ja","text":"【関係代名詞】《関係詞whatより堅く》...するもの, ...すること","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_bf66200a933574e15ce0","expressionId":"x_dc2a9e6da2f55adf5a4b","language":"ja","text":"...に達する,到達する,着く / 取り掛かる / 《~ do》（だんだん）…するようになる, …し始める / 《~ do》（機会があって）…できる, …する機会を得る","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_74b7b9cf8fd72ba309eb","expressionId":"x_1d19d96bfedbade74661","language":"ja","text":"《対比》他方では, その一方で, 別の見方をすれば","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e6a1d7aea237a6b57fee","expressionId":"x_0139b47c512cca3e9462","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ 》（主語の）後に...が続く","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_6d55107afc436507062d","expressionId":"x_771cbb22715b437d2cb4","language":"ja","text":"（むしろ）…したいと思う,  …することに決める《do》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5a3ae133f00dbb3f2fa6","expressionId":"x_78eeb43b21ef0c647da2","language":"ja","text":"...でさえない, ...さえない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_88954ea5922a8e01b512","expressionId":"x_3fb6ea53925ea3856b4f","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》 （物・方法）によって, ...を用いて","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5e1427df26d30fed5cd0","expressionId":"x_fa3e03e688c5bef08f7f","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》...が得意である, ...が上手である","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5ea8f18bb412fe34d60b","expressionId":"x_61f8a6309fb4309ffcc9","language":"ja","text":"ほんの, 単なる / 単に…にすぎない, まったく…にすぎない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_3fa140989ddeb1b5d038","expressionId":"x_906585717f6514b7619b","language":"ja","text":"平均で, 平均して / 一般に, 大抵は","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e12f6608e39d5e3cd238","expressionId":"x_e03ad8f144a3abb4877c","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ 》責めを負うべきである / 《be ~ for ...》...の責任がある","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_49b087c214741268bf7f","expressionId":"x_115648e47de1eef35a6d","language":"ja","text":"【名/U/C】 《...の》解消, 絶縁, 崩壊, 分裂, 解体 《of ...》/ 破綻する,別れる；（結婚・関係など）を終わらせる / ばらばらになる,分解される； をばらばらに分解する","source":"PHRASE"}]